===============================================================================
Third-party components
===============================================================================

Nothing below is bundled, vendored, or redistributed by this package. Each
component is either a dependency the user installs separately with pip, or an
external command-line tool the user installs and this plugin invokes as a
subprocess. This section is therefore informational: because no third-party
code is redistributed here, none of these licenses places a redistribution
obligation on this package. It is recorded so that a reader can see the full
set of software a review run touches without having to read the code.

Each license below was read from the metadata of the version observed in this
project's development environment, and the observed version is named where the
upstream license has changed across major versions. Copyright holders are not
reproduced: attribution is by project name and upstream location, which is
where the authoritative notice lives.


Declared Python dependencies
----------------------------

PyYAML
    License   : MIT
    Role      : the sole run-time dependency (Requirement 16 AC3). Parses
                CloudFormation YAML, including the intrinsic-function short
                forms, through the plugin's own SafeLoader subclass.
    Upstream  : https://github.com/yaml/pyyaml
    Bundled   : no. Installed by the user with "pip install PyYAML".

pytest
    License   : MIT
    Role      : development and test only, via the "dev" extra of
                pyproject.toml. Not imported by iacreview/ or skills/.
    Upstream  : https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest
    Bundled   : no.

pytest-cov
    License   : MIT
    Role      : development and test only, via the "dev" extra. Measures
                coverage, including in Skill subprocesses.
    Upstream  : https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest-cov
    Bundled   : no.

Hypothesis
    License   : MPL-2.0
    Role      : development and test only, via the "dev" extra. Drives the
                property-based tests under tests/property/.
    Upstream  : https://github.com/HypothesisWorks/hypothesis
    Bundled   : no.


External command-line tools
---------------------------

These are executed as separate processes with argument arrays. This plugin
reads their output and normalizes it; it does not link against them or copy
any part of them.

cfn-lint
    License   : MIT-0 (MIT No Attribution), as declared by cfn-lint 1.46.0.
                Releases before the 1.x series were licensed Apache-2.0.
    Role      : deterministic CloudFormation syntax and resource specification
                checks.
    Upstream  : https://github.com/aws-cloudformation/cfn-lint
    Bundled   : no. The user installs it; the plugin reports a missing tool
                rather than fetching one.

cloudformation-guard (cfn-guard)
    License   : Apache-2.0, as declared by cfn-guard 3.2.1.
    Role      : evaluates the policy rules under rules/ against a template.
    Upstream  : https://github.com/aws-cloudformation/cloudformation-guard
    Bundled   : no. The rules under rules/ are original to this project and
                are covered by this package's own license.

AWS CDK CLI (aws-cdk)
    License   : Apache-2.0.
    Role      : optional. Runs "cdk synth" to obtain a template from CDK
                source, and only when the user passes --confirm-cdk-synth.
    Upstream  : https://github.com/aws/aws-cdk-cli
    Bundled   : no.


